# STARK XTerm

STARK XTerm is a web interface providing a terminal to launch STARK command within STARK CLI service (Docker container)

## Build

```bash
docker build -t stark-xterm .
```

## Launch 

```bash
docker run --rm -p 8000:8000 -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock -v ./users.json:/app/users.json stark-xterm
```
